  "notes": "Classic shadcn/ui zinc styling: white cards with 1px #e4e4e7 borders and shadow-sm, 8px card radius, 6px button radius, pill vote groups. The page background has a faint square grid texture plus a very soft pale-blue diagonal glow at top-left. The Word-of-the-day card is set apart by a darker border and a black pill badge. Report is the only colored element (red #ef4444). Each card's example sentence is muted grey and quoted, and author lines use an em-dash '— @user · date'. A login redirect landed on the home page while signed in; the avatar menu shows the user's email. The 'I'm feeling lucky' random-term button is a nice touch."
